# `vercel deploy` uploads the raw working directory and does NOT read
# .gitignore the same way git does — a gitignored file still gets packed
# into the upload unless it's listed here too. This is what made
# `vercel deploy --prod` fail with "File size limit exceeded (100 MB)":
# gigawork-v2.rar (1.4GB, a local backup archive, not part of the app)
# was getting uploaded whole.
*.rar
*.zip
*.7z

# Local dev artifacts that have no business in a deploy upload.
.next
node_modules
.git
